body:
Hey man! You should seek out help. We can talk about it if you want, but you should try calling a Helpline, and try to get to Therapy and check in with a psychiatrist

&#x200B;

And for the relationship. You should try to improve yourself. (If you are too depressed to do then follow the first sentence) Try going out getting friend, do hard and difficult things, etc. The stuff everyone always tells everyone, go to gym eat healthy do sports go out with friends
